  "description": "Alpha Yeon In-Jun and Omega Kwon Se-In fell in love in high school but remained friends. However, that changes when Choi Jae-Kyung steals Se-In away by imprinting on him while In-Jun is studying abroad. But when In-Jun and Jae-Kyung get into a car accident, In-Jun wakes up in the other alpha's body! He slowly learns of Jae-Kyung's schemes to take advantage of Se-In's family connections and does his best to protect his omega. Will In-Jun and Se-In get their happily ever after, or has Jae-Kyung damaged their relationship beyond repair?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra.*",
